    "# Notebook 3: Clinical Text Processing with BioClinical BERT\n",
    "## MIMIC-IV 30-Day Readmission Prediction - Colab Arm\n",
    "\n",
    "**Objective**: Process clinical text (discharge notes, radiology reports) using BioClinical Modern BERT following meeting notes 10/27/2025.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Architecture Alignment**: This notebook implements Step 4 from the meeting notes:\n",
    "- **Text Encoder**: BioClinical Modern BERT (long-context variant or sliding-window pooling)\n",
    "- **Token budget**: 4096 tokens (long-context) or 512 with stride 128 aggregation\n",
    "- **Note types**: Discharge summaries primary, optionally concatenate recent notes\n",
    "- **Output**: Admission-level pooled embeddings per note type\n",
    "\n",
    "**Integration with src/**: Uses existing text processing patterns from src/text/"
